Astrodynamics Course Repository

This repository hosts the complete course delivery materials for Fundamentals of Astrodynamics — a rigorous, competency-based textbook built on evidence-based educational science.

## Repository Structure

### Policy Documents
- `/course-policies/course-curriculum.md` — Competency framework, module map, and authoring policy
- `/course-policies/assessment-expectations.md` — Stage-based assessment plan and grading
- `/course-policies/lecture-readiness-standard.md` — Chapter readiness checklist for publication
- `/course-policies/student-ability-tracking.md` — Competency tracking policy and rating scale

### Course Delivery
Canonical lecture content is authored under:

```
/course-delivery/
  teaching-tracker.md                    ← Operational progress and competency tracker
  module-01-foundations/
    chapter-01-introduction-to-two-body-dynamics/
      lecture-01-newtonian-gravity-and-two-body-assumptions.md
```

### Module Status
| Module | Status |
|--------|--------|
| Module 01 — Foundations | 🟡 In progress (Lectures 01–02 published) |
| Module 02 — Core Orbital Mechanics | ⬜ Not started |
| Module 03 — Maneuvers and Mission Design | ⬜ Not started |
| Module 04 — Integration and Professional Practice | ⬜ Not started |
